        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="u2aHrqAUeqZqV6IxxZCq-5" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=light-dark(#FFFFFF,#007FFF);" value="LOGIN" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="20" width="60" x="250" y="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="u2aHrqAUeqZqV6IxxZCq-6" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fontStyle=1;fontSize=18;" value="How It Works?" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="150" x="50" y="190" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="u2aHrqAUeqZqV6IxxZCq-7" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;rounded=0;" value="&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;You scan your bills. Our AI engine structures the data for you; which you can edit, if needed.&amp;nbsp; Finally you save your bill.&amp;nbsp; Many such bills helps you track your expenditure over time, plan your purchases; household or other, and also provide meaningful data whenever you need it.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="260" x="50" y="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="u2aHrqAUeqZqV6IxxZCq-8" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fontStyle=1;fontSize=18;" value="Why we created this app?" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="240" x="50" y="330" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="u2aHrqAUeqZqV6IxxZCq-9" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;rounded=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;1. Inflation&lt;/b&gt; - The inflation numbers we read in newspapers are personally irrelevant.&amp;nbsp; When you have saved receipts over a few months or years, you can really look back at the change in your spending over time.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;2. Expense Tracking&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;- Lets say you use this app to track household expenses.&amp;nbsp; You&#39;ll be able to easily and quickly get information on how much your spending is in any period.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;3. Stock management&lt;/b&gt; -&amp;nbsp; Again, taking the example of household expenses, you can very easily understand the amount of groceries yo&lt;b&gt;u &lt;/b&gt;need in every category.&amp;nbsp; This helps you plan your purchases and benefit from&amp;nbsp;wholesale purchases; for example.&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="260" width="260" x="50" y="360" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="u2aHrqAUeqZqV6IxxZCq-11" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fontStyle=1;fontSize=18;" value="How are we different?" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="240" x="50" y="630" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="u2aHrqAUeqZqV6IxxZCq-12" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;rounded=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;1. Pay as you go: &lt;/b&gt;We don&#39;t have a monthly subscription; instead you pay on the go.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;2. 100 free credits: &lt;/b&gt;As a &quot;thankyou&quot; for choosing our app, we help you get started with 100 credits (which roughly is equivalent to $1).&amp;nbsp; You can add credits as an when you prefer and also get an instant refund when you no longer want to use our app.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;3. Excellent Reporting:&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;We provide you with several reports that can help you with in-depth analysis of your invoices and expenses.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;4. Its your app: &lt;/b&gt;We have a Feedback button and its a very active button.&amp;nbsp; You can share your ideas and your feedback which we take in very sincerely and improve the app to make it more useful for everyone.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="290" width="260" x="50" y="650" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
